---
/** Customer voice. Lexicon rules relax inside it: the words are the customer's, not the brand's. */
---
<blockquote class="quote" data-customer-voice><slot /></blockquote>
<style>
  .quote {
    margin: 0; padding-left: var(--sp-3);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-visible);
    font-size: var(--t-lead); line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>
